{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-12","timestamp_unix_ms":1776814523286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Neither could she deny the justice of his description of Jane.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-13","timestamp_unix_ms":1776864541286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He had not a temper to bear the sort of competition in which we stood--the sort of preference which was often given me.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-14","timestamp_unix_ms":1784417974286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Every day at Longbourn was now a day of anxiety; but the most anxious part of each was when the post was expected.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-15","timestamp_unix_ms":1784420658286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Oh dear, yes; but you must own she is very plain.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-16","timestamp_unix_ms":1784427796286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Collins was only a clergyman; and it affected them in no other way than as a piece of news to spread at Meryton.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-17","timestamp_unix_ms":1784435651286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Collins she thought with equal certainty, and with considerable, though not equal, pleasure.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-18","timestamp_unix_ms":1784438820286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" Elizabeth could not refuse, though she foresaw little pleasure in the visit.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-19","timestamp_unix_ms":1784441391286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Through letters, whatever of good or bad was to be told would be communicated; and every succeeding day was expected to bring some news of importance.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-20","timestamp_unix_ms":1784455105286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Forster,\" said she, \"it will be quite shocking to send her away!","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-21","timestamp_unix_ms":1784455408286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"It was consoling that he should know she had some relations for whom there was no need to blush.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-22","timestamp_unix_ms":1784458980286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"The reason of this sudden removal was soon evident.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-23","timestamp_unix_ms":1784463307286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Bingley,\" said Elizabeth, \"must disarm reproof.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-24","timestamp_unix_ms":1785378174286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"What did Colonel Forster say?","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-25","timestamp_unix_ms":1785382439286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"No one who has ever seen you together can doubt his affection; Miss Bingley, I am sure, cannot: she is not such a simpleton.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-26","timestamp_unix_ms":1785384001286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"He was the proudest, most disagreeable man in the world, and everybody hoped that he would never come there again.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-27","timestamp_unix_ms":1785400595286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Some time hence it will be all found out, and then we may laugh at their stupidity in not knowing it before. I know we dine with four-and-twenty families.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-28","timestamp_unix_ms":1785412963286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"Hill began instantly to express her joy.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-29","timestamp_unix_ms":1785414032286,"direction":"outgoing","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":null,"sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":"I have nothing either to hope or fear, and nothing to reproach him with.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
{"guid":"1to1-+18018708704-30","timestamp_unix_ms":1785419862286,"direction":"incoming","service":"imessage","message_kind":"imessage","sender_handle":"+18018708704","sender_display_name":null,"subject":null,"text":" He then went away, and Miss Bingley was left to all the satisfaction of having forced him to say what gave no one any pain but herself.","attachments":[],"imessage":null,"source":null}
